  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fadeInDuration: 3
  dialogueLines:
  - "Ugh... time for work already. Night shifts at the caf\xE9 always bring in the
    weirdos."
  - Rent's due soon. Just one more shift until payday.
  - "Wait\u2014was that window open before? Huh."
  - Let me make sure I've changed, turned off the TV, and closed that window before
    heading out.
  - "Everyday is the same. Feels like d\xE9j\xE0 vu, like I'm stuck waiting for one
    last order..."
